modern-esm-mcq-003.example:
```js
// ESM: static, hoisted, top-level only
import { readFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
console.log(typeof readFile); // 'function'

// Conditional loading needs DYNAMIC import (returns a promise):
async function load(flag) {
  if (flag) {
    const os = await import('node:os');
    return os.platform();
  }
}
load(true).then((p) => console.log('platform:', p));
```

array-concat-001.example:
