array-every-002.example:
```js
const seen = [];
const result = [2, 4, 5, 6].every((n) => {
  seen.push(n);
  return n % 2 === 0; // fails at 5
});
console.log(result); // false
console.log(seen);   // [2, 4, 5] — stopped after the first failure (6 never visited)
```

array-fill-002.example:
```js
