array-find-002.example:
```js
const sparse = [1, , 3]; // hole at index 1
const found = sparse.find((v) => v === undefined);
console.log(found); // undefined — the hole is visited and matches
let visits = 0;
sparse.find(() => { visits++; return false; });
console.log(visits); // 3 — every index visited, including the hole
```

